<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine pension funds managed $7.94 bln in July.</title>
<headline>Argentine pension funds managed $7.94 bln in July.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Funds managed by Argentina's private pension system rose to $7.94 billion in July from $7.34 billion the previous month, the Superintendency of Pension and Retirement Funds said Thursday.</p>
<p>In July 1996, the funds managed $3.99 billion.</p>
<p>((--Jorge Otaola, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0651))</p>
</text>
